# The framework's site's secrets (F124) - COPY TO .env.secrets AND FILL IN YOUR VALUES. .env.secrets is git-ignored and
# is never committed.
#
# Anthropic API key, for the guide's turns (https://console.anthropic.com). Without it the pages still serve, and the
# guide can't answer.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Key for the site's API: required (FX18). The guide's door lets a visitor in without it; everything else needs it.
AGENT_API_KEY=
# The admin's own key, for /admin/overview (F127.8). Empty: the admin takes AGENT_API_KEY.
ADMIN_API_KEY=
# Each other server's own key, as name=key pairs by commas, the names those of AGENT_PEERS (F127.3.2). A server with
# none is sent AGENT_API_KEY. Empty: the site's agents ask no other server.
AGENT_PEER_KEYS=
# Resend's key, for the guide's lead mail (F112). Without it the lead goes to the log.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# The password of the chats' database in Azure (F43.1), 16 letters and digits or more: deploy.ps1 infra gives it to
# the cluster, and deploy.ps1 secrets puts the address it signs in with in the vault. The local copy needs none.
# CHATS_DATABASE_PASSWORD=
